  "description": "Maeng Jeong-Jin, a baseball coach, has been kicked out of his team. With the help of a senior, he finally joined the Sun Devils, but the team is now in the abyss of factional strife. His only hope for survival is politics. To survive in a baseball world where skill alone is insufficient, Maeng Jeong-Jin embarks on a journey of \"politics.\"\n\n(Source: Kakaopage)",
